  "title": "Suspicious Rundll32 Execution via Known LOLBAS Patterns",
  "id": "8b9c0d1e-2f3a-4b4c-5d6e-7f8a9b0c1d2e",
  "description": "Detects rundll32.exe invoked with command-line patterns associated with known living-off-the-land abuse (zipfldr, shdocvw, advpack, comsvcs minidump, etc.)",
